atch by next week.
Can you please explain with little more detail. We just want to make sure y=
our idea fits in for pci iov also.

[Sethi Varun-B16395] In the add device notifier we can allocate the streamI=
D (and the corresponding smmu master), while allocating the iommu group for=
 the PCI devices. All, the PCIe devices sharing the same iommu group would =
share the stream ID.  Currently, I am working on a add device framework for=
 hot plug devices.

-Varun

